?url=%2Fimages%2Fhomepage%2Fcompany-logo%2Fcomptia.png&amp;w=96&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fhomepage%2Fcompany-logo%2Fcomptia.png&amp;w=320&amp;q=75 2x" src="./India’s Best Private University in Punjab - LPUuu_files/comptia.png"></div></div></div></section><section class="holistic-learning-area section-spacing"><div class="container"><div class="heading-wraper"><div class="sub-head white">360° LEARNING ECOSYSTEM<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 500 150" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6.1,133.6c0,0,173.4-20.6,328.3-14.5c154.8,6.1,162.2,8.7,162.2,8.7s-262.6-4.9-339.2,13.9 c0,0,113.8-6.1,162.9,6.9"></path></svg></div><div class="main-head"><h2 class="white">Your Growth, Our Priority: Empowering every student through a complete learning experience</h2></div></div><div class="holistic-wrapper"><div class="holistic-box"><div class="holistic-content"><h3 class="c white">EduRev: Education that transforms learning into real outcomes</h3><p class="holistic-description white">Edu Rev goes beyond textbooks by bringing learning, earning, and growth together in one journey. With AI-personalised learning, gamified education, and research-driven assessments, it creates a smooth path from classroom learning to real-world application, while also enabling students to earn back a part of their semester fee.</p><a target="_blank" class="border-link-btn" href="https://www.lpu.in/edurev/">Know More About EduRev<!-- --> <span class="arrow"></span></a></div><div class="holistic-image"><a target="_blank" href="https://www.lpu.in/edurev/"><img alt="EduRev learning ecosystem at LPU" loading="lazy" width="999" height="479" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" style="color:transparent" sizes="(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 50vw" srcset="/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fhomepage%2Fholistic-learning%2Fedurev.webp&amp;w=320&amp;q=75 320w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fhomepage%2Fholistic-learning%2Fedurev.webp&amp;w=420&amp;q=75 420w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fhomepage%2Fholistic-learning%2Fedurev.webp&amp;w=768&amp;q=75 768w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fhomepage%2Fholistic-learning%2Fedurev.webp&amp;w=1024&amp;q=75 1024w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fhomepage%2Fholistic-learning%2Fedurev.webp&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fhomepage%2Fholistic-learning%2Fedurev.webp&amp;w=1440&amp;q=75 1440w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fhomepage%2Fholistic-learning%2Fedurev.webp&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w" src="./India’s Best Private University in Punjab - LPUuu_files/edurev.jpeg"></a></div></div><div class="holistic-box"><div class="holistic-content"><h3 class="c white">Bharat Innovation Challenge 2025-26 Grand Finale at LPU</h3><p class="holistic-description white">LPU hosted the Bharat Innovation Challenge 2025-26, India's largest brain marathon, attracting 2,600 teams and 10,000+ participants from 28 states and 500+ cities. From 10 themes, 120 finalists presented prototypes, judged by 21 industry experts &amp; leaders.</p></div><div class="holistic-image"><img alt="Bharat Innovation Challenge at LPU" loading="lazy" width="999" height="479" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" style="color:transparent" sizes="(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 50vw" srcset="/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fhomepage%2Fholistic-learning%2Fbharat-innovation-challenge.webp&amp;w=320&amp;q=75 320w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fhomepage%2Fholistic-learning%2Fbharat-innovation-challenge.webp&amp;w=420&amp;q=75 420w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fhomepage%2Fholistic-learning%2Fbharat-innovation-challenge.webp&amp;w=768&amp;q=75 768w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fhomepage%2Fholistic-learning%2Fbharat-innovation-challenge.webp&amp;w=1024&amp;q=75 1024w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fhomepage%2Fholistic-learning%2Fbharat-innovation-challenge.webp&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fhomepage%2Fholistic-learning%2Fbharat-innovation-challenge.webp&amp;w=1440&amp;q=75 1440w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fhomepage%2Fholistic-learning%2Fbharat-innovation-challenge.webp&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w" src="./India’s Best Private University in Punjab - LPUuu_files/bharat-innovation-challenge.jpeg"></div></div><div class="holistic-box"><div class="holistic-content"><h3 class="c white">One World 2026: A Grand Celebration of Global Diversity</h3><p class="holistic-description white">One World 2026, inaugurated by Abhishek Manu Singhvi, alongside H.E. Desire Boniface Some, Able Dungui Mavungo, and Mohamed Ali Mohamed Fazari, transformed the campus into a dynamic global hub, celebrating diversity, fostering connections, and showcasing how learning extends beyond classrooms into real-world global engagement.</p></div><div class="holistic-image"><img alt="One World 2026 celebration at LPU" loading="lazy" width="999" height="479" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" style="color:transparent" sizes="(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 50vw" srcset="/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fhomepage%2Fholistic-learning%2Fone-world-2026.webp&amp;w=320&amp;q=75 320w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fhomepage%2Fholistic-learning%2Fone-world-2026.webp&amp;w=420&amp;q=75 420w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fhomepage%2Fholistic-learning%2Fone-world-2026.webp&amp;w=768&amp;q=75 768w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fhomepage%2Fholistic-learning%2Fone-world-2026.webp&amp;w=1024&amp;q=75 1024w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fhomepage%2Fholistic-learning%2Fone-world-2026.webp&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fhomepage%2Fholistic-learning%2Fone-world-2026.webp&amp;w=1440&amp;q=75 1440w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fhomepage%2Fholistic-learning%2Fone-world-2026.webp&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w" src="./India’s Best Private University in Punjab - LPUuu_files/one-world-2026.jpeg"></div></div><div class="holistic-box"><div class="holistic-content"><h3 class="c white">Spectra 2026: A Grand Celebration of Youth &amp; Talent</h3><p class="holistic-description white">Spectra 2026 was held at LPU with vibrant enthusiasm, inaugurated by Dr. Ashok Kumar Mittal and Hon'ble Pro-Chancellor Col. (Dr.) Rashmi Mittal. Featuring 30+ categories, 2,000+ participants from 25 schools, and the EduRev Conclave, the festival celebrated creativity, competition, and student excellence.</p></div><div class="holistic-image"><img alt="Spectra 2026 youth and talent celebration at LPU" loading="lazy" width="999" height="479" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" style="color:transparent" sizes="(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 50vw" srcset="/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fhomepage%2Fholistic-learning%2Fspectra.webp&amp;w=320&amp;q=75 320w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fhomepage%2Fholistic-learning%2Fspectra.webp&amp;w=420&amp;q=75 420w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fhomepage%2Fholistic-learning%2Fspectra.webp&amp;w=768&amp;q=75 768w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fhomepage%2Fholistic-learning%2Fspectra.webp&amp;w=1024&amp;q=75 1024w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fhomepage%2Fholistic-learning%2Fspectra.webp&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fhomepage%2Fholistic-learning%2Fspectra.webp&amp;w=1440&amp;q=75 1440w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fhomepage%2Fholistic-learning%2Fspectra.webp&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w" src="./India’s Best Private University in Punjab - LPUuu_files/spectra.jpeg"></div></div><div class="holistic-box"><div class="holistic-content"><h3 class="c white">LPU Shines at the 39th AIU Inter-University North Zone Youth Festival</h3><p class="holistic-description white">LPU delivered an exceptional cultural performance, proudly securing the Overall First Runners-Up Trophy and marking yet another milestone in its journey of excellence on inter-university cultural platforms, inspiring young artists to dream big, perform bigger, and lead with creativity.</p></div><div class="holistic-image"><img alt="AIU Inter-University North Zone Youth Festival at LPU" loading="lazy" width="999" height="479" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" style="color:transparent" sizes="(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 50vw" srcset="/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fhomepage%2